<title>USA: Coventry names Dale Wolf CFO.</title>
<headline>Coventry names Dale Wolf CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coventry Corp said Wednesday it named Dale Wolf to the post of chief financial officer, replacing Richard Jones.</p>
<p>The company noted Jones was promoted to president and chief executive officer of Group Health Plan, a Coventry unit based in St. Louis, Mo.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
